{"kind":"FETCH","data":{"headers":{},"body":"[{\"title\":\"The Journey`s End\",\"number\":1,\"airDate\":\"2023-09-29\",\"duration\":26,\"synopsis\":\"The world celebrates the Demon King's defeat at the hands of the Hero and his companions. Now that their great adventure is over, what will Frieren the mage do next?\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/v4/episode/9350138/screencap/6516db4c3a389.jpg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"冒険の終わり\"},{\"title\":\"It Didn`t Have to Be Magic...\",\"number\":2,\"airDate\":\"2023-09-29\",\"duration\":26,\"synopsis\":\"Frieren instructs Fern in the use of magic while deciphering a grimoire for Heiter.\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/v4/episode/9993737/screencap/6516dba58b3fb.jpg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"別に魔法じゃなくたって...\"},{\"title\":\"Killing Magic\",\"number\":3,\"airDate\":\"2023-09-29\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"While retracing the path she took on her adventure with her former traveling companions, Frieren confronts an old enemy.\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/v4/episode/9993738/screencap/6516dbf654876.jpg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"人を殺す魔法\"},{\"title\":\"The Land Where Souls Rest\",\"number\":4,\"airDate\":\"2023-09-29\",\"duration\":26,\"synopsis\":\"Frieren and Fern pay a visit to Eisen, who requests their help in finding the notes of Flamme the Legendary Mage.\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/v4/episode/9993739/screencap/6516dc5905a4d.jpg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"魂の眠る地\"},{\"title\":\"Phantoms of the Dead\",\"number\":5,\"airDate\":\"2023-10-06\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Frieren and Fern investigate ghost sightings at a village where people have started going missing.\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/v4/episode/9993740/screencap/651c1d2bb51d0.jpg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"死者の幻影\"},{\"title\":\"The Hero of the Village\",\"number\":6,\"airDate\":\"2023-10-13\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Frieren and Fern enlist Stark's help to fight the solar dragon - but is he up to the task?\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/v4/episode/9993741/screencap/6525543a01309.jpg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"村の英雄\"},{\"title\":\"Like a Fairy Tale\",\"number\":7,\"airDate\":\"2023-10-20\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"After reflecting on the transient nature of the past as it exists in people's collective memories, Frieren unexpectedly runs into a sworn enemy.\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/v4/episode/9993742/screencap/652efc320885c.jpg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"おとぎ話のようなもの\"},{\"title\":\"Frieren the Slayer\",\"number\":8,\"airDate\":\"2023-10-27\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"As tensions in Graf Granat's domain reach a breaking point, Fern and Stark find their own resolve - and Frieren resumes an old duty.\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/v4/episode/9993743/screencap/6537f02d13812.jpg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"葬送のフリーレン\"},{\"title\":\"Aura the Guillotine\",\"number\":9,\"airDate\":\"2023-11-03\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"While Fern and Stark make a temporary retreat with Graf Granat, Frieren's true foe awaits her outside the city.\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/v4/episode/9993744/screencap/654120a437854.jpg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"断頭台のアウラ\"},{\"title\":\"A Powerful Mage\",\"number\":10,\"airDate\":\"2023-11-10\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Frieren's many years of training under her teacher Flamme are tested in her confrontation with Aura the Guillotine. Will Aura's scales find her wanting?\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/v4/episode/9993745/screencap/654a84b7ce6ed.jpg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"強い魔法使い\"},{\"title\":\"Winter in the Northern Lands\",\"number\":11,\"airDate\":\"2023-11-17\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Frieren and her companions continue their journey through the northern lands, but obstacles both natural and manmade still stand in their way.\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/v4/episode/9993746/screencap/655384b0cb330.jpg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"北側諸国の冬\"},{\"title\":\"A Real Hero\",\"number\":12,\"airDate\":\"2023-11-24\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Deep in the mountains of the northern lands, Frieren and her party arrive at the Village of the Sword, where they have another job to do.\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/v4/episode/9993747/screencap/655ccc7b3af99.jpg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"本物の勇者\"},{\"title\":\"Aversion to One`s Own Kind\",\"number\":13,\"airDate\":\"2023-12-01\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"While passing by a village in the woods of the northern lands, Frieren and party meet Sein, a gifted priest who is nonetheless corrupt enough to give even Heiter a run for his money. But what happened in his past?\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/v4/episode/10057050/screencap/6566533a28a09.jpg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"同族嫌悪\"},{\"title\":\"Privilege of the Young\",\"number\":14,\"airDate\":\"2023-12-08\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"The party arrives in a large and lively town with a bustling shopping district that Frieren once visited with Himmel, but something seems to have come up between Fern and Stark.\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/v4/episode/10057051/screencap/656f4338bce78.jpg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"若者の特権\"},{\"title\":\"Smells Like Trouble\",\"number\":15,\"airDate\":\"2023-12-15\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"When the party happens upon a town whose inhabitants are all mysteriously asleep, it's time for their newest traveling companion to prove his mettle.\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/v4/episode/10057052/screencap/6578681405dfa.jpg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"厄介事の匂い\"},{\"title\":\"Long-Lived Friends\",\"number\":16,\"airDate\":\"2023-12-22\",\"duration\":24,\"synopsis\":\"Frieren pays a visit to Old Man Voll, a long-lived friend of hers, with traveling companions in tow.\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/v4/episode/10057054/screencap/658b5526a03f5.jpg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"長寿友達\"},{\"title\":\"Take Care\",\"number\":17,\"airDate\":\"2024-01-05\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Now that Sein finally has a lead on the whereabouts of his long-lost friend, is it time for him and Frieren's party to part ways?\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/v4/episode/10057056/screencap/659adba284e6d.jpg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"じゃあ元気で\"},{\"title\":\"First-Class Mage Exam\",\"number\":18,\"airDate\":\"2024-01-12\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Frieren and party finally arrive in Äußerst, ready to undergo the first-class mage exam, and meet a number of colorful characters who are there to do the same.\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/v4/episode/10057058/screencap/659d4cf65c4aa.jpg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"一級魔法使い選抜試験\"},{\"title\":\"Well-Laid Plans\",\"number\":19,\"airDate\":\"2024-01-19\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Frieren and her new teammates hatch a plan to capture a Stille - but are the other teams just going to stand by and let it happen?\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/v4/episode/10057061/screencap/65a69070d4e1f.jpg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"入念な計画\"},{\"title\":\"Necessary Killing\",\"number\":20,\"airDate\":\"2024-01-26\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"The first-class mage exam intensifies as fighting breaks out between the participants - and what's at stake might even be worth killing for.\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/v4/episode/10057064/screencap/65afb9c87c277.jpg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"必要な殺し\"},{\"title\":\"The World of Magic\",\"number\":21,\"airDate\":\"2024-02-02\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Frieren, Kanne, and Lawine struggle with the 13th party over possession of the Stille, but there'll be more surprises in store before their battle, and the first test, reach their conclusion.\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/v4/episode/10057067/screencap/65b971031f20c.jpg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"魔法の世界\"},{\"title\":\"Future Enemies\",\"number\":22,\"airDate\":\"2024-02-09\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"After the conclusion of the first test, the exam participants have some time to kill in town. What do mages get up to on their days off?\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/v4/episode/10057069/screencap/65c329e26d027.jpg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"次からは敵同士\"},{\"title\":\"Conquering the Labyrinth\",\"number\":23,\"airDate\":\"2024-02-16\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"The aspiring first-class mages now face their second test: conquering the Ruins of the King's Tomb. A simple task, or so the proctor claims, but there's a reason this particular dungeon remains unexplored.\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/v4/episode/10057071/screencap/65cb96020dbab.jpg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"迷宮攻略\"},{\"title\":\"Perfect Replicas\",\"number\":24,\"airDate\":\"2024-02-23\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Due to the Spiegel, a legendary monster that can create perfect replicas of others, the test-takers who would conquer the Ruins of the King's Tomb must first face the ultimate enemy: themselves.\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/v4/episode/10057072/screencap/65d4bfcc5a74c.jpg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"完璧な複製体\"},{\"title\":\"A Fatal Vulnerability\",\"number\":25,\"airDate\":\"2024-03-01\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"A perfect imitation of Frieren stands between the test-takers and victory, but Fern believes she knows how to win. Is it time for the student to surpass the master?\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/v4/episode/10057073/screencap/65ddf33f9c6ae.jpg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"致命的な隙\"},{\"title\":\"The Height of Magic\",\"number\":26,\"airDate\":\"2024-03-08\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"To defeat Spiegel, Frieren and Fern fight against Frieren's replica, but have a tough time. Meanwhile, Denken, Lavine, and the others fight against the replicas, but the magic of Sense, a first-class mage and the exam's proctor, rages.\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/v4/episode/10086091/screencap/65e750eb8cbe8.jpg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"魔法の高み\"},{\"title\":\"An Era of Humans\",\"number\":27,\"airDate\":\"2024-03-15\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"With the second test behind them, only one remains - but first, Frieren and Fern need to settle an important matter in town. What awaits them in the third test?\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/v4/episode/10086092/screencap/65f468dd5a039.jpg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"人間の時代\"},{\"title\":\"It Would Be Embarrassing When We Met Again\",\"number\":28,\"airDate\":\"2024-03-22\",\"duration\":24,\"synopsis\":\"As the first-class mage exam concludes and the test-takers go their separate ways, farewell leads to departure - but the next stage of Frieren's journey has only just begun.\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/v4/episode/10086093/screencap/65f95e7dcf03d.jpg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"また会ったときに恥ずかしいからね\"}]","status":200,"url":""},"revalidate":3600,"tags":[]}